<title>SWEDEN: Average rate 4.09 pct on Swedish 7-day T-bill.</title>
<headline>Average rate 4.09 pct on Swedish 7-day T-bill.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted rate in an auction of seven-day Treasury bills was 4.091 percent, the National Debt Office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The office had invited bids for a total of 20 billion crowns. The lowest rate was 4.080 percent and the highest accepted rate 4.099 percent.</p>
<p>The paper matures on January 29.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
